# Welcome to the Rogallo Documentation!

This is a sample of some Gemtext, served by a Gemini Capsule.

## Places to go from here

There are many places you can go from here, if you want to explore Geminispace. You could drop in on Dave's little capsule:

=> gemini://tilde.team/~davep/

Or you could read all about the Gemini Protocol:

=> gemini://geminiprotocol.net/

Other locations worth a first visit are:

=> gemini://astrobotany.mozz.us/ AstroBotany
=> gemini://station.martinrue.com/ Station
=> gemini://lagrange-point.space/ Lagrange Point

And so many more!

